  "Description": {
    "Cost": 10955383,
    "UIName": "Cephalus",
    "Id": "chassisdef_cephalus_CPH-T",
    "Name": "Cephalus",
    "Details": "The T configuration of the Cephalus OmniMech, the Society's light escort for the Septicemia, carries a turret mount in each side torso. Each turret holds an ER Medium Laser and an ER Small Laser, joined by an improved one-shot SRM-4 on the left and a Rocket Launcher 10 on the right. Void Weave Armor makes it much harder to detect, a Remote Sensor Dispenser lets it seed the battlefield with sensors, and its Nova CEWS links it with friendly units. Like the Society's other early OmniMechs, it is now mostly kept to guarding important assets.\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Quirk: Improved Lifesupport</color></b>\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Drop Cost Multiplier: 1.01</color></b>\n\n<color=#FFEF00>Arm Actuator Limits: Omni</color>",
    "Icon": "Cephalus"
  },
