  "StockRole": "Scout",
  "YangsThoughts": "Now this is a slippery little bastard. Between the Null Signature System, Chameleon Shield, and that kind of speed, getting a clean shot at the Cephalus is going to be a challenge all by itself. It’s not carrying much firepower, but with the Nova CEWS and Remote Sensors, it doesn’t need to—the rest of the lance can do the shooting.",
